      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting, immediately after the word \"tobacco\" in the definition of \"cigarette\", words \"either with or without any other added ingredient\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the definitions of \"gallon\", \"proof gallon\" and \"proof spirit\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"licensed warehouse\" the following: \"licensed warehouse\" means a warehouse or other place licensed under section 25 for the warehousing of dutiable goods, and includes—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "customs warehouse under section 65;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any warehouse licensed under sections 65 and 65A; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any inland clearance depot licensed under section 65B, Act 235. of the Customs Act 1967, for the warehousing of goods of a similar class to such dutiable goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 4 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words \"Deputy Director,\" in the second line of subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of that subsection a comma and inserting immediately thereafter the words \"other than those conferred by section 18.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 14 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substituting for the words \"by unavoidable accident, lost, damaged or destroyed\" in subsection (1) the words \"damaged, destroyed or, by unvoidable accident, lost\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 15 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "renumbering it as \"15. (1)\" and inserting immediately thereafter the following new subsections (2), (3), (4) and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ": \"(2) Where any amount is payable in accordance with subsection (1), the Director General may allow the amount to be paid by instalments in such amounts and on such dates as he may determine. (3) If after a reasonable time has lapsed and the amount due is not paid by such person, after giving not less than thirty days' notice in writing to such person, the Director General may sell any goods detained under subsection (1). (4) The proceeds of sale of any such goods shall be applied to the payment of the amount due, and the surplus, if any, shall be paid to such person. (5) If the sale of such goods is by auction, such auction shall be conducted by or in the presence of a senior officer of excise.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 16 of the principal Act is amended by inserting,"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "immediately after the word \"stored\", the words \"or from any other place under excise control\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 19 the following: \"Drawback. 19. (1) Where any goods are exported by the manufacturer as part or ingredient of any goods manufactured in the Federation or as the packing, or part or ingredient of the packing, of such manufactured goods, then if excise duty has been paid on that part or ingredient of such manufactured goods or on the packing or that part or ingredient thereof, the Director General may, on such export, allow to the manufacturer a full drawback of the duty so paid, if— (a) the finished goods have been manu- factured on premises approved by the Director General; (b) such books and account are kept as the Director General may require for the purpose of ascertaining the quantity of the goods used in such manufacture or for or in the packing of such manufactured goods; (c) such goods are so exported within twelve months of the date upon which excise duty was paid or such further period as the Director General may approve; and- (d) written notice has been given on the export declaration form that a claim for drawback will be made, and such claim is made in the prescribed form and established to the satisfaction of the senior officer of excise within six months of the date such export or such further period as the Director General may approve. (2) In this section, the expression \"manufacturer\" includes any person to whom the manufactured goods have been sold or otherwise disposed of.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 23 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the comma in paragraph (c) of subsection (1) a semicolon and inserting immediately thereafter the word \"or\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting, immediately after paragraph (c) of the said subsection, the following new paragraph (d): \"(d) any other place under excise control.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting in Part IV,"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "immediately after section 23, the following new sections 23 A and 23B: 23A. (1) Where an effective resolution is passed or an order is made for the winding-up of a company to which a licence under this Act is issued, the liquidator of the company shall give notice thereof to the Director General within fourteen days thereafter, and shall before disposing of any of the assets of the company set aside such sum out of the assets as appears to the Director General to be sufficient to provide for any excise duty that is or will thereafter become payable in respect of the company. (2) A liquidator of any such company who fails to give notice to the Director General within the time specified in subsection (1) or fails to provide for payment of the excise duty as required by that subsection shall be personally liable for any excise duty that is or becomes payable as aforesaid. (3) Where two or more persons are appointed liquidators or are required by law to carry out the winding-up of any such company, subject to a right of contribution between themselves as in cases of contract, the obligations and liabilities attaching to a liquidator under this section shall attach to all such persons jointly and severally. 23B. (1) Where a receiver is. appointed of the property of a company to which a licence under this Act is issued, the receiver shall give notice thereof to the Director General within fourteen days thereafter, and shall before disposing of any of the assets of that company set aside such sum out of the assets as appears to the Director General to be sufficient to provide for any excise duty that is or will thereafter become payable in respect of the dutiable goods that have been sold by the company before the appointment of the receiver. (2) A person appointed as receiver who fails to give notice to the Director General within the time specified in subsection (1) or fails to provide for payment of the excise duty as required by that subsection shall be personally liable for any excise duty that is or becomes payable as aforesaid. (3) Where two or more persons are appointed receivers, subject to a right of contribution between themselves as in cases of contract, the obligations and liabilities attaching to a receiver under this section shall attach to all such persons jointly and severally.\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
